  <item>
    <title>EP10.职场态度｜职场发疯和撕逼，可以但没必要</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e6ea7a8d5665c00898d7b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e6ea7a8d5665c00898d7b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎉🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>“做人没必要太正常”，“与其被人逼疯，不如主动发疯”，职场“发疯”文学盛行，有人是冲在最前线的践行者，有人偷偷羡慕又学不来，有人坚决否定。本期节目，我们想一起聊聊职场的那些发疯和撕逼时刻，吃瓜抓马瞬间～但同时，我们也认为“发疯”可以但没必要，做个体面打工人才是王道～</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也感兴趣这个话题，欢迎大家的订阅和分享，也欢迎vx搜索bobo_xiaoma加入我们的听友群，一起快乐聊聊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️🎙️🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> “发疯”应该是勇敢say no维护权益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 内卷环境造就“发疯”和“撕逼”现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 职场小朋友是“发疯”文学的受害者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 吃瓜时刻：职场发疯和撕逼时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 无辜被甩锅，该撕就撕～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 发疯或许有用，但不长久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 守住底线，但情绪稳定，是职场最大的利器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 识别利益共同体，解决问题是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 相信人性本善，但再一再二没有再三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a> 养成良好职业习惯和素养，做个体面打工人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1777">29:37</a> 面对心术不正，所有事情放在阳光下～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltyZ5AyCvdMZVW0dwXwG3LGRnF04.m4a" length="31851908" type="audio/mp4"/>
