  <item>
    <title>EP9. 咖啡时间｜无证咖啡师，带你60分钟从入门到精通</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ddbe2435dd8780ed49aa58</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ddbe2435dd8780ed49aa58</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎉🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作一堆昏了头，咖啡一杯解千愁！每日咖啡，已经是很多打工人的日常。家庭咖啡角，为家人朋友做一杯完美拉花的拿铁，或者开个有情怀的咖啡店，真是浪漫又chill～本期节目，老张不装了，为了立住他「无证咖啡师」的人设，跟我们分享他的入坑体验，带我们60分钟从入门到精通～</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也感兴趣这个话题，欢迎大家的订阅和分享，也欢迎vx搜索bobo_xiaoma加入我们的听友群，一起快乐聊聊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️🎙️🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 速溶咖啡，一代人的咖啡启蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 星巴克，深烘香气营造的高级感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 小马的咖啡之路，从开始到放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 老张的咖啡入坑，源于理科生超强的动手能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 你觉得好喝的咖啡就是好咖啡！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 手冲 v.s. 意式，个性张扬 v.s. 平衡的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 豆子、咖啡师、设备，对一杯咖啡品质的影响排序？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 咖啡机，你是真的需要么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a> 入坑咖啡你可能忽略的隐形成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 入坑到进阶：分段萃取、打奶泡、拉花，探索豆子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2284">38:04</a> 无设备入门，试试冷萃～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2452">40:52</a> 咖啡态度：压力萃取，星河璀璨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 咖啡因上瘾致癌？抛开剂量谈毒性，都是耍流氓！</span></p>]]></description>
