  <item>
    <title>EP8.人际关系｜朋友一起的碎碎念念，是细水长流的岁岁年年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d47a3a0847349e0c6b7c2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d47a3a0847349e0c6b7c2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Feb 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎉🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>三毛说，朋友这种关系，最美在于锦上添花；最可贵，贵在雪中送炭；朋友中的极品，便如好茶，谈而不涩，清香但不扑鼻，缓缓而来，似水长流。本期节目，我们想浅谈朋友相处的话题，那些有些时日不曾联系的老朋友，那些曾经看走眼的狐朋狗友，以及那些关于朋友的心结和遗憾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也感兴趣这个话题，欢迎大家的订阅和分享，也欢迎vx搜索bobo_xiaoma加入我们的听友群，一起快乐聊聊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️🎙️🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> i人小马见故友，跌宕的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 朋友的定义和相处方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 朋友也是分类分级的～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 见朋友，是营业还是be yourself？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">16:39</a> 过了事儿才是真朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 避雷！带着目的接近你的“朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 既怕兄弟苦，又怕兄弟开路虎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 远离！把你当情绪“垃圾桶”的“朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> 有些朋友，天各一方就慢慢走散了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 最好的朋友，更要好好沟通认真经营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 触及底线的朋友，干脆切割</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 我的朋友，有你真好！</span></p>]]></description>
