  <item>
    <title>EP7.情人节特辑｜决定结婚的那一刻，爱胜过一切</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cb5d2b35dd8780edc31909</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cb5d2b35dd8780edc31909</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎉🎉🎉</span></p><span></span><p><span>Happy Valentine's Day！今年的情人节，无论你是两个人甜甜蜜蜜，还是一个人过得精彩，都祝大家财运情运双双顺利。本期节目，我们分享了各自从恋爱到结婚的过程，以及结婚对我们的改变和意义。结婚对于我们，都是非常幸运的时刻和经历，希望大家也能收获自己的爱情，有情人终成眷属～</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也感兴趣这个话题，欢迎大家的订阅和分享，也欢迎vx搜索bobo_xiaoma加入我们的听友群，一起快乐聊聊～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️🎙️🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 校园爱情也靠谱，一路从恋爱到结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 就是他/她了，情绪价值给足了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 家人的祝福，是感情稳定的基石</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> 虽然没有求婚，但“哥养你”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> 最近工作太闲，去领证吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 一切都刚刚好的目的地婚礼，推荐推荐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> 有遗憾，但也泪崩当场的传统婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a> 女婿回门，献族谱的庄重仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 钱没谈拢，让人大开眼界的婚礼见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a> 结婚，是给人生增添一份安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> 婚姻送命题，你有过想离婚的时刻么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> 理想婚姻生活，越平淡越长久～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmrFghM5ElEVBFVRFS_R6d6WqTDg.m4a" length="57421032" type="audio/mp4"/>
